cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: libgen-mcp
abstract: >-
  A Model Context Protocol server, written in Go, that lets an AI assistant
  search the Library Genesis catalog and a set of open-access sources, fetch a
  record's metadata with BibTeX and RIS citations, and download and read books
  and papers, with no account or API key.
authors:
